<Service>
  <Name>WMS</Name>
  <Title>Landcare Research NZ Topographic Baselayer</Title>
  <Abstract>This is a WMS for Landcare Research&#39;s Topographic Base Map Layer, operated as part of the SCENZ-Grid project. The data contained in this project covers the terrain, hydrography, transport infrastructure, settlements, coastline and coastal features of New Zealand. This service runs a MapServer (http://mapserver.org/index.html) on top of a PostgreSQL / PostGIS database (http://www.postgresql.org/)(http://postgis.refractions.net/).</Abstract>
  <KeywordList>
      <Keyword></Keyword>
  </KeywordList>
  <OnlineResource xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="https://maps.scinfo.org.nz/basemaps/wms?"/>
  <ContactInformation>
    <ContactPersonPrimary>
      <ContactPerson>David Medyckyj-Scott</ContactPerson>
      <ContactOrganization>Landcare Research New Zealand Limited</ContactOrganization>
    </ContactPersonPrimary>
      <ContactPosition>Myscenz-Grid Project Leader</ContactPosition>
    <ContactAddress>
        <AddressType>Postal</AddressType>
        <Address>Landcare Research, Private Bag 11052, Manawatu Mail Centre</Address>
        <City>Palmerston North</City>
        <StateOrProvince>Manawatu</StateOrProvince>
        <PostCode>4442</PostCode>
        <Country>New Zealand</Country>
    </ContactAddress>
      <ContactVoiceTelephone>+64 6 353 4800</ContactVoiceTelephone>
      <ContactFacsimileTelephone>+64 6 353 4800</ContactFacsimileTelephone>
  <ContactElectronicMailAddress>Medyckyj-ScottD@landcareresearch.co.nz</ContactElectronicMailAddress>
  </ContactInformation>
  <Fees>none</Fees>
  <AccessConstraints></AccessConstraints>
  <MaxWidth>8192</MaxWidth>
  <MaxHeight>8192</MaxHeight>
</Service>

